        "content": "⭐ POST-STAY REVIEW REQUEST AUTOMATION\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n🎯 Automatically requests reviews from guests  after checkout\n📝 Includes Google Reviews and TripAdvisor links\n\n💡 BOOSTS: Online reputation | Future bookings | Guest loyalty | Review volume",
